---
import StationMark from "./StationMark.astro";
---

<figure aria-label="Dot identity">
  <div class="dot-pair">
    {["A", "B"].map((station) => (
      <div class="dot-station">
        <div class="dot-label"><StationMark station={station} /><strong>Station {station}</strong></div>
        <dl>
          <dt>Local counter</dt>
          <dd><code>1</code></dd>
          <dt>Dot (replica, counter)</dt>
          <dd><code>({station}, 1)</code></dd>
        </dl>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    The replica ID makes equal counter values distinct: <code>(A, 1)</code> and
    <code>(B, 1)</code> name different additions. Each station allocated its own counter
    value of <code>1</code>; the matching numbers do not indicate which event came first.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .dot-pair {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-5);
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
  }

  .dot-label {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  dl {
    margin: var(--space-4) 0 0;
  }

  dt {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  dd {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-3);
  }

  dd:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 1.75rem);
  }
</style>
